    "2️⃣ ADJECTIVEDAN ADVERB YASASH (-ly)\n\nquick → quickly, careful → carefully, beautiful → beautifully\nbad → badly, quiet → quietly, happy → happily (y→i+ly)\neasy → easily, terrible → terribly, possible → possibly",
