    "4️⃣ GOOD (ADJ) VA WELL (ADV)\n\nGood — adjective:\n  She is a good student. This is a good book. The food is good.\n\nWell — adverb:\n  She speaks English well. He plays football well.\n\nWell — shuningdek 'sog'' ma'nosida adjective:\n  I am well. She doesn't feel well.",
